  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1965-27/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.65288
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Your letter reached me as I was sitting on that very same spot on the grass!",
      "path": "audio/1965-27/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.039116,
      "end": 5.882245
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "What I was thinking then I shall tell you only when we meet.",
      "path": "audio/1965-27/03.mp3",
      "start": 7.381927,
      "end": 10.755078999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "What a fragrance memories leave behind!",
      "path": "audio/1965-27/04.mp3",
      "start": 12.205374,
      "end": 14.447823
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "When life is filled with love it is so blissful.",
      "path": "audio/1965-27/05.mp3",
      "start": 15.875964000000002,
      "end": 19.245351
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Life's only paupers are those without love in their hearts, and how to describe the good fortune of those whose hearts hold nothing but love!",
      "path": "audio/1965-27/06.mp3",
      "start": 20.655034,
      "end": 30.016395
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "In moments of such abundance one encounters God Only love alone have I known as God.",
      "path": "audio/1965-27/07.mp3",
      "start": 31.61771,
      "end": 38.77
    }
  ]
}
